          <span class="footer__link" style="cursor:default;">Exclusiv Online (Discord / Meet)</span>
          <span class="footer__link" style="cursor:default;">Orar Flexibil (inclusiv weekend)</span>
          <span class="footer__link" style="cursor:default;">120 lei/oră | 150 lei/oră urgențe</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer__bottom">
      <span>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Meditații Poli. Toate drepturile rezervate.</span>
